\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b How Transformers Power Generative AI\par
\b0 Generative AI models use Transformers to predict the most likely next token.\par
Example:\par
Input:\par
"Artificial Intelligence is"\par
Prediction:\par
"transforming"\par
Next prediction:\par
"the"\par
Next prediction:\par
"world"\par
The model generates one token at a time, producing coherent text, code, or images.\par
