\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\ul\b\fs28 Pre\f2 -\f0 training\f2  \f0 vs\f2  \f0 Fine\f2 -\f0 tuning\f2  \f0 in\f2  \f0 Generative\f2  \f0 AI\ulnone\b0\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj\fs24 Large\f2  \f0 Language\f2  \f0 Models\f2  (\f0 LLMs\f2 ) \f0 such\f2  \f0 as\f2  \f0 GPT\f2 , \f0 Gemini\f2 , \f0 and\f2  \f0 Claude\f2  \f0 are\f2  \f0 typically\f2  \f0 developed\f2  \f0 in\f2  \f0 two\f2  \f0 major\f2  \f0 stages\f2 : \f0 Pre\f2 -\f0 training\f2  \f0 and\f2  \f0 Fine\f2 -\f0 tuning\f2 . \f0 Pre\f2 -\f0 training\f2  \f0 helps\f2  \f0 the\f2  \f0 model\f2  \f0 learn\f2  \f0 general\f2  \f0 language\f2  \f0 patterns\f2  \f0 and\f2  \f0 knowledge\f2  \f0 from\f2  \f0 massive\f2  \f0 datasets\f2 , \f0 while\f2  \f0 fine\f2 -\f0 tuning\f2  \f0 specializes\f2  \f0 the\f2  \f0 model\f2  \f0 for\f2  \f0 specific\f2  \f0 tasks\f2 , \f0 domains\f2 , \f0 or\f2  \f0 business\f2  \f0 requirements\f2 . \f0 Together\f2 , \f0 these\f2  \f0 stages\f2  \f0 enable\f2  \f0 Generative\f2  \f0 AI\f2  \f0 systems\f2  \f0 to\f2  \f0 produce\f2  \f0 accurate\f2 , \f0 context\f2 -\f0 aware\f2 , \f0 and\f2  \f0 useful\f2  \f0 outputs\f2 .\par
\b 1. What is Pre-training?\b0\par
Pre-training is the first phase of building an AI model, where the model learns from a very large dataset containing books, websites, articles, code repositories, and other publicly available text.\par
During this stage, the model learns:\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj Grammar and language structure\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Facts and general knowledge\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Relationships between words\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Context understanding\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Reasoning patterns\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj The model is trained to predict the next word (or token) in a sentence.\par
\b Characteristics of Pre-training\par
\b0\f3\u9989?\f2  Uses massive datasets\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Requires enormous computing power\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Takes weeks or months of training\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Produces a general-purpose model\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Learns broad knowledge but not task-specific expertise\par
\b 2. What is Fine-tuning?\par
\b0 Fine-tuning is the second stage, where a pre-trained model is further trained on a smaller, specialized dataset to improve performance for a particular task or domain.\par
The goal is to adapt the model to specific requirements.\par
\b Characteristics of Fine-tuning\b0\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Uses smaller specialized datasets\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Less computational cost\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Improves task-specific accuracy\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Adapts model to business needs\par
\f3\u9989?\f2  Makes responses more relevant and domain-focused.\par
